# Build context for the API image (Dockerfile). Allow-list: everything is
# excluded unless named below, so data/, .venv, node_modules, docs/evidence,
# tests, frontend, edge, migrations, scripts and every .env* file can never
# reach the image or the build cache, whatever new files appear in the repo.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!requirements/api.lock.txt
!requirements/build.lock.txt

# Local build and editor residue that may sit inside src/.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store
